WEBVTT

1
00:00:09.820 --> 00:00:12.080
I've chased down every question

2
00:00:12.080 --> 00:00:13.780
Read the books and followed every thread

3
00:00:13.780 --> 00:00:16.880
But standing at the edge of all I know

4
00:00:21.500 --> 00:00:29.160
I feel a deeper hunger in me

5
00:00:32.100 --> 00:00:38.560
There's a thirst that won't be satisfied

6
00:00:38.560 --> 00:00:40.080
By everything the world has shown

7
00:00:40.080 --> 00:00:42.120
We gather pearls of wisdom as we go

8
00:00:42.700 --> 00:00:43.300
But the deepest truths remain unknown

9
00:00:46.280 --> 00:00:46.580
We learn from what our senses tell us

10
00:00:48.900 --> 00:00:50.660
We trust the ones who came before

11
00:00:51.300 --> 00:00:53.760
We reason through the darkness for a light

12
00:00:54.180 --> 00:00:56.940
But something's calling out for more

13
00:01:24.920 --> 00:01:26.360
Human minds have built cathedrals

14
00:01:28.100 --> 00:01:30.040
Mapped the stars and split the atom wide

15
00:01:30.800 --> 00:01:33.000
But when I ask "Why am I here?"

16
00:01:33.460 --> 00:01:33.860
The world has never satisfied

17
00:01:37.300 --> 00:01:39.380
Ever learning, never landing

18
00:01:40.200 --> 00:01:41.960
On the ground where certainty begins

19
00:01:42.600 --> 00:01:44.580
I've found the limits of my reach —

20
00:01:44.860 --> 00:01:47.200
Now I'm ready to look within

21
00:01:49.440 --> 00:01:49.700
Faith and learning, companions in the same cause

22
00:01:56.060 --> 00:01:57.240
Walking toward the light that never dims

23
00:01:58.160 --> 00:01:58.840
What the mind begins to question

24
00:02:02.420 --> 00:02:03.920
The spirit can complete

25
00:02:04.460 --> 00:02:05.720
Truth is knowable — God is not silent

26
00:02:05.720 --> 00:02:05.742
He's waiting at the edge of all we seek

27
00:02:05.720 --> 00:02:05.743
How did all of this begin?

28
00:02:05.720 --> 00:02:05.745
Is there purpose in the change?

29
00:02:05.720 --> 00:02:05.748
Is someone guiding, watching, reaching down

30
00:02:05.720 --> 00:02:05.751
To meet me where I am?

31
00:02:05.720 --> 00:02:05.755
I won't cling to fear of answers

32
00:02:05.720 --> 00:02:05.760
I won't hide behind my doubt

33
00:02:05.720 --> 00:02:05.767
Great wisdom leads to peace, I'm told

34
00:02:05.720 --> 00:02:05.776
And I'm ready to find out

35
00:02:05.720 --> 00:02:05.790
Faith and learning, companions in the same cause

36
00:02:05.720 --> 00:02:05.813
Walking toward the light that never dims

37
00:02:05.720 --> 00:02:05.860
What the mind begins to question

38
00:02:05.720 --> 00:02:06.000
The spirit can complete

39
00:02:06.000 --> 00:02:08.700
Truth is knowable — God is not silent

40
00:02:08.700 --> 00:02:09.780
He's waiting at the edge of all we seek

41
00:02:13.740 --> 00:02:15.640
I am more than flesh and reasoning

42
00:02:19.180 --> 00:02:21.660
There's a spirit living here inside

43
00:02:25.220 --> 00:02:28.340
When I reached beyond what I could prove

44
00:02:30.240 --> 00:02:34.760
That's when God became real to me

45
00:02:39.060 --> 00:02:40.920
The questions didn't disappear

46
00:02:42.360 --> 00:02:45.000
But fear gave way to hope

47
00:02:46.740 --> 00:02:49.540
In the stillness something spoke to me:

48
00:02:50.660 --> 00:02:51.800
"You were never searching alone"

49
00:02:53.040 --> 00:02:54.740
This is when God becomes real —

50
00:02:56.760 --> 00:02:59.340
Not a theory, but a voice you feel

51
00:03:18.020 --> 00:03:18.380
Faith and learning, companions in the same cause

52
00:03:24.700 --> 00:03:25.920
Walking toward the light that never dims

53
00:03:26.820 --> 00:03:27.520
What the mind begins to question

54
00:03:30.300 --> 00:03:33.040
The spirit can complete

55
00:03:33.260 --> 00:03:34.360
Truth is knowable — God is not silent

56
00:03:37.680 --> 00:03:38.520
He's waiting at the edge of all we seek

57
00:03:41.940 --> 00:03:44.280
So if you're standing where I stood

58
00:03:46.720 --> 00:03:47.920
Hungry, searching, wondering if it's real

59
00:03:49.000 --> 00:03:52.600
Ask Him — just speak what's in your heart

60
00:03:53.200 --> 00:03:55.180
He has answered me

61
00:03:55.980 --> 00:03:59.840
He will answer you

62
00:04:07.960 --> 00:04:08.740
Truth is knowable

63
00:04:11.100 --> 00:04:12.500
Peace can be found

64
00:04:13.780 --> 00:04:14.940
This I promise

65
00:04:17.120 --> 00:04:18.800
In the name of Jesus Christ

66
00:04:20.860 --> 00:04:21.240
Amen.
